- `src/game.rs` — pure, UI-free game logic: 10×20 board, 7 tetrominoes (4×4 matrices, 90° rotations with wall kicks), 7-bag randomizer, collision/lock/line-clearing, scoring (100/300/500/800 + soft/hard drop points), levels with gravity 800ms→80ms, pause/game-over states.
- `src/main.rs` — ratatui + crossterm UI: board with ghost piece, next-piece preview, score/level/lines panel, pause and game-over overlays, ~60fps loop with time-based gravity, small-terminal guard.

**Controls**: ←/→ move, ↓ soft drop, ↑/z rotate, x rotate ccw, space hard drop, p pause, r restart, q/esc quit.

